{"id": "farrell-2010-forfeiture-settlement", "title": "A $190,903 forfeiture demand ended in a $25,000 campaign settlement", "seconds": 49.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.01, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "5e1bad4729bb7c9d", "words": 142, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Chris Lee coordinated with Common Sense Voters during Mark Farrell’s 2010 campaign for supervisor.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.53, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "owed", "the", "forfeiture?"], "sub": "Mark Farrell for District 2 Supervisor 2010"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.72, 1.34, 1.5, 1.82, 2.09, 2.43, 2.69, 2.93, 3.36, 3.68, 3.92, 4.4, 4.54]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The state fined Lee and the committee $14,500.", "t0": 5.65, "t1": 9.61, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$190,903.04", "label": "Forfeiture demand"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.53, 0.94, 1.23, 1.37, 1.47, 1.91, 2.41, 2.9, 3.15, 3.4]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco valued the excess in-kind contributions at $190,903.04.", "t0": 9.73, "t1": 16.12, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "San Francisco valued the excess in-kind contributions at $190,903.04"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.76, 1.11, 1.26, 1.72, 2.29, 3.02, 3.18, 3.38, 3.67, 3.92, 4.33, 4.52, 4.78, 4.99, 5.31, 5.44, 5.68]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City demanded that amount from the campaign.", "t0": 16.24, "t1": 18.39, "shot": "r2-detail", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The City demanded that amount from the campaign"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.47, 0.86, 1.02, 1.31, 1.47, 1.57]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In July 2015 the Ethics Commission sent the unpaid claim to the Bureau of Delinquent Revenue.", "t0": 18.61, "t1": 24.05, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "referral", "kicker": "Collection referral", "text": "$190,903.04", "mark": "$190,903.04"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.49, 0.75, 1.85, 2.04, 2.37, 2.82, 3.04, 3.15, 3.55, 3.92, 4.03, 4.15, 4.49, 4.58, 5.02]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Farrell’s counsel disputed that his campaign had received the money.", "t0": 24.17, "t1": 27.25, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "Case", "text": "16-551745", "mark": "16-551745"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.83, 1.31, 1.47, 1.61, 2.15, 2.3, 2.66, 2.78]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Farrell sued and the City countersued.", "t0": 27.37, "t1": 29.3, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Farrell sued and the City countersued"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.78, 0.91, 1.02, 1.29]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Chair Paul Renne cited the risk of having to pay for Farrell’s lawyers.", "t0": 29.52, "t1": 32.87, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$25,000", "label": "Settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.62, 0.87, 1.18, 1.3, 1.54, 1.65, 1.9, 2.01, 2.29, 2.46, 2.84]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In October 2016 commissioners approved a $25,000 settlement by a vote of 3 to 2.", "t0": 32.99, "t1": 39.84, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "In October 2016 commissioners approved a $25,000 settlement by a vote of 3 to 2"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.72, 1.07, 2.18, 2.78, 3.24, 3.33, 3.87, 4.22, 4.51, 5.46, 5.65, 5.75, 6.01, 6.15, 6.41, 6.53]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "KQED later reported that Farrell paid $25,000.", "t0": 39.96, "t1": 43.87, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "kqed", "kicker": "Payment reported", "text": "